  "title": "How AI can bridge the Deaf and hearing worlds",
  "author": "Adam Munder",
  "url": "https://www.ted.com/talks/adam_munder_how_ai_can_bridge_the_deaf_and_hearing_worlds",
  "annotation_id": null,
  "completed_by": 7,
  "created_at": "2026-05-07T02:22:52.523968Z",
  "updated_at": "2026-05-07T02:22:52.523968Z",
  "lead_time": 42.276,
  "result": [
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "0",
        "end": "0",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 28,
        "text": "Christan Hansen: Adam, wait.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4CA8AC1C60",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "1",
        "end": "1",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 25,
        "text": "They need an interpreter.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E4E273A33A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "2",
        "end": "2",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 14,
        "text": "Now I'm ready.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "840488128B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "3",
        "end": "3",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 9,
        "text": "Go ahead.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "003C6DC16D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "4",
        "end": "4",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 36,
        "text": "Hello, you guys need an interpreter.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7B440C4AF9",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "5",
        "end": "5",
        "startOffset": 14,
        "endOffset": 100,
        "text": "briefly experiencing what it's like for me and millions of other Deaf people worldwide",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F18A4E5F35",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "5",
        "end": "5",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 216,
        "text": "Thank you for briefly experiencing what it's like for me and millions of other Deaf people worldwide when we don't have an interpreter and we need to order a coffee, check into a hotel, or complete other daily tasks.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "DCEDA6D599",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "6",
        "end": "6",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 64,
        "text": "What I was trying to share with you was a frustrating experience",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D237DD9623",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "7",
        "end": "7",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 72,
        "text": "My wife is also Deaf and we took our daughter to a doctor's appointment.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "986146B047",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "8",
        "end": "8",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 74,
        "text": "When we arrived, I'd asked for either an on-site or a virtual interpreter.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "DBFD2AAF71",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "9",
        "end": "9",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 125,
        "text": "Unfortunately, they told me neither were available, so I had to write back and forth with the receptionist at the front desk.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2C75637EE4",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "10",
        "end": "10",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 86,
        "text": "To make matters worse, when the doctor came into the room, he said, \"Oh, it's alright.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A0D62DFBA6",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "11",
        "end": "11",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 49,
        "text": "We'll just have your daughter interpret for you.\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E4D538A1C1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "12",
        "end": "12",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 20,
        "text": "So could you imagine",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "66965B8D6F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "12",
        "end": "12",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 150,
        "text": "So could you imagine going to the doctor's appointment and being told by the doctor that your seven-year-old is going to relay the information to you?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6150D89D64",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "13",
        "end": "13",
        "startOffset": 33,
        "endOffset": 53,
        "text": "two different worlds",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3CF36A6148",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "13",
        "end": "13",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 70,
        "text": "This was just one example of the two different worlds that I navigate.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3FF79C81F5",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "14",
        "end": "14",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 121,
        "text": "In my personal life, I raise my kids, I manage rental properties, I flip buildings, and I'm working on a coffee roastery.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "750F903FE2",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "15",
        "end": "15",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 113,
        "text": "In this world, I interact with hearing individuals every day: teachers, lawyers, real estate agents, contractors.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CCC841816F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "16",
        "end": "16",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 135,
        "text": "Yet still to this day, I have to rely on a smartphone to text back and forth or write with paper and pen to the people I interact with.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BA034694C0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "17",
        "end": "17",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 115,
        "text": "Then I have the professional world where I have succeeded, in part due to having two highly qualified interpreters.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "FB47B058BA",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "18",
        "end": "18",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 108,
        "text": "I have the same degrees, the same educational background, the same job responsibilities as my hearing peers.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "56243FBCC2",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "19",
        "end": "19",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 84,
        "text": "I solve the same engineering problems in a very competitive, fast-paced environment.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1A821F1511",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "20",
        "end": "20",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 34,
        "text": "But the playing field isn't level.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7136E3FE48",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "21",
        "end": "21",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 111,
        "text": "And all of my daily collaborations, all of my meetings and presentations, everything hinges on my interpreters.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "58469BAE3F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "22",
        "end": "22",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 28,
        "text": "I am very fortunate, though.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "60ADF4CBFA",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "23",
        "end": "23",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 93,
        "text": "My employer ensures that I have access to the same information that my hearing colleagues do.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "445BC94BDC",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "24",
        "end": "24",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 67,
        "text": "Unfortunately, this is not true for many Deaf throughout the world.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7BF71568E0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "25",
        "end": "25",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 43,
        "text": "Interpreters are very expensive and scarce.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7F34640705",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "26",
        "end": "26",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 89,
        "text": "Where I live in Arizona, there are more than 1.1 million individuals with a hearing loss.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "35B593689D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "27",
        "end": "27",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 41,
        "text": "And only about 400 licensed interpreters.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "79408AEAFE",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "28",
        "end": "28",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 94,
        "text": "So there's scarcity of tools available for us, and our communication options are very limited.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BE240EE3EE",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "29",
        "end": "29",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 90,
        "text": "This puts us in a survival mode, forcing us to use the resources that are at our disposal.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7688EFAC0B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "30",
        "end": "30",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 115,
        "text": "Writing back and forth on paper and pen, or using a smartphone to text is not equivalent to American Sign Language.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "10E0CC6ECD",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "31",
        "end": "31",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 50,
        "text": "The details and nuance that make us human are lost",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "038AE5A2DB",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "32",
        "end": "32",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 59,
        "text": "So we're bringing the humanity back to these conversations.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F607F498B6",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "33",
        "end": "33",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 56,
        "text": "I've done that by building a platform called OmniBridge.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "95547033B5",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "34",
        "end": "34",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 84,
        "text": "So my team has established this bridge between the Deaf world and the hearing world.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "81E0726908",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "35",
        "end": "35",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 73,
        "text": "Bringing these worlds together without forcing one to adapt to the other.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C52B6E1299",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "36",
        "end": "36",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 100,
        "text": "So we're using the power of AI to analyze thousands of signs in ASL and translate them into English.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E9911A90D1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "37",
        "end": "37",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 55,
        "text": "Now, thousands may seem small, but ASL is very complex.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "FBF85FD411",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "38",
        "end": "38",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 84,
        "text": "With slight nuance and changes in body language it can change the meaning of a sign.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B047AFAE49",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "39",
        "end": "39",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 29,
        "text": "For instance, the sign \"big.\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B9B7F4CBBE",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "40",
        "end": "40",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 14,
        "text": "Or \"enormous.\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2DF85D1C66",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "41",
        "end": "41",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 163,
        "text": "Today, with the advancement in compute on AI PCs, we're able to run our models locally without relying on the internet, which dramatically increases accessibility.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2F99CB9113",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "42",
        "end": "42",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 59,
        "text": "So I'd like to show you an alpha version of this in action.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C919544083",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "43",
        "end": "43",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 116,
        "text": "And I want to show you how this could have changed my interaction at the doctor appointment had this been available.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "35E3F4EC17",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "44",
        "end": "44",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 35,
        "text": "I'd like to invite Hasiba on stage.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A49CBAE3B9",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "45",
        "end": "45",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 69,
        "text": "She's going to pretend to be our receptionist at the doctor's office.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0E8244039F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "46",
        "end": "46",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 34,
        "text": "What you're going to see on screen",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5E4974F5FE",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "46",
        "end": "46",
        "startOffset": 40,
        "endOffset": 66,
        "text": "bidirectional conversation",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0C5A1A71FC",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "47",
        "end": "47",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 172,
        "text": "Hasiba: Hi, how's it going? [Hi, how's it going?] (Applause) [I am good.] [I will like to use your technology to communicate with you.] Hasiba: Sure, we can use OmniBridge.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9D709802B1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "48",
        "end": "48",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 42,
        "text": "Could you tell me the name of the patient?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "294A0BF985",
